# Force LF line endings for shell scripts + git hooks. CRLF in a script
# with a #!/usr/bin/env bash shebang breaks on Linux + WSL (interpreter
# resolves to `bash\r` which doesn't exist). The hooks run inside Git
# Bash on Windows, so LF is universally safe.
*.sh         text eol=lf
.githooks/*  text eol=lf
